WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.578
Namaste.

00:00:00.578 --> 00:00:08.095
Is video mein hum The Ray ko Transport aur Material supply ke business ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:08.095 --> 00:00:10.986
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:10.986 --> 00:00:21.611
Retti, bajri, cement ya eent bechne wale business mein maal ke saath gaadi ka bhada bhi lagta hai, aur dono ka hisaab ek hi bill mein hona chahiye.

00:00:21.956 --> 00:00:22.739
Naya bill.

00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:30.645
Existing customer mein Anita Mehta ko chunte hain, aur material mein M Sand, yaani retti, jodte hain.

00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:36.047
Material ka rate per brass hota hai, isliye unit bhi wahi dikhta hai.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.397
Ab Add transport charge. Yahan gaadi chunte hain, Tipper das pahiye.

00:00:41.397 --> 00:00:44.537
Uska rate per kilometre pehle se likha hai.

00:00:44.537 --> 00:00:49.796
Distance atharah kilometre, driver ka naam Ajit More, aur load chhe ton.

00:00:49.796 --> 00:00:54.398
Add to bill dabate hi bhada bill mein alag line ban gaya. Kyun?

00:00:54.398 --> 00:01:01.921
Kyunki customer ko dikhna chahiye ki maal ka kitna aur gaadi ka kitna, aur GST dono par sahi lagta hai.

00:01:02.299 --> 00:01:08.598
Bill ki line mein dono cheezein aa gayi: retti aur uska transport. Total apne aap bana.

00:01:08.598 --> 00:01:14.752
Ab Complete bill dabakar customer se sirf teen hazaar rupaye lete hain, baaki udhaar.

00:01:14.752 --> 00:01:21.630
Transport wale business mein udhaar bahut hota hai, isliye khata yahan bhi utna hi zaroori hai.

00:01:22.002 --> 00:01:27.375
Dekhiye, invoice mein material aur transport dono lines hain, GST ke saath.

00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:34.681
Ye ek hi invoice hai, isliye customer ko ek hi bill milta hai, aur aapko ek hi entry karni padi. Kyun?

00:01:34.681 --> 00:01:38.693
Alag alag bill banane mein galti aur der dono hoti hain.

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:43.791
Ab Vehicles. Har gaadi ka naam, number, aur per kilometre rate.

00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:47.393
JCB pachaas rupaye per kilometre, Tipper adtees.

00:01:47.393 --> 00:01:54.071
Kuch gaadiyon par Insurance expired ya Insurance expires in chaubees din likha hai. Kyun?

00:01:54.071 --> 00:02:01.875
Kyunki bina insurance ya P U C ki gaadi par challan lagta hai, aur ye alert pehle se yaad dila deta hai.

00:02:02.251 --> 00:02:04.620
Kisi gaadi ka Edit kholte hain.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:10.965
Naam, number, rate, aur chaar tareekh: R C, insurance, P U C aur fitness ki expiry.

00:02:10.965 --> 00:02:15.933
Jaise hi koi tareekh paas aati hai, upar alert aa jata hai. Kyun?

00:02:15.933 --> 00:02:21.742
Kyunki paanch chhah gaadiyon ke document yaad rakhna kaagaz par mushkil hai.

00:02:22.119 --> 00:02:22.813
Customers.

00:02:22.813 --> 00:02:29.757
Bade material ke customer aksar udhaar lete hain, isliye har naam ke saamne baaki amount dikhta hai.

00:02:29.757 --> 00:02:36.492
Priya Chavan ka baaki achha khaasa hai. Kisi ko kholo to poora khata aur WhatsApp reminder. Kyun?

00:02:36.492 --> 00:02:42.810
Kyunki materials ka udhaar bada hota hai, aur ek mahine ki bhi der se bahut fark padta hai.

00:02:43.179 --> 00:02:45.910
Aur ye Transport report, vehicle wise.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:52.306
Har gaadi ne kitne round kiye, kitne kilometre chali, kitna load uthaya aur kitna kamaya.

00:02:52.306 --> 00:02:56.475
Neeche driver wise bhi. Upar tareekh badal sakte ho. Kyun?

00:02:56.475 --> 00:03:03.590
Kyunki pata chalta hai kaun si gaadi fayde mein hai, aur kaun sa driver sabse zyada trip karta hai.

00:03:03.955 --> 00:03:18.353
Aaj humne Transport aur Material ka flow dekha: material bill, gaadi aur distance ke saath transport charge, ek invoice mein dono, part payment aur udhaar, gaadi ke document ki expiry, aur vehicle wise trip report.

00:03:18.353 --> 00:03:22.389
Ek practical baat: har trip par driver ka naam zaroor likho.

00:03:22.389 --> 00:03:27.166
Mahine ke end mein wahi driver wise hisaab aur zimmedari tay karta hai.
